    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512-a1">

                <pb facs="1578" n="1420" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1420"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister of Foreign
                            Relations to Minister O’Brien</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-03-15"><hi rendition="#italic">March 15,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Minister</hi>: With my best compliments I
                    can inform you that yesterday at 11 p.m. I received from Washington the
                    following cablegram: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Secretary accepts with especial thanks. I made him aware of
                            initiative.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">(Signed) <hi rendition="#small-caps">Requena
                                Bermudez.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>Yours, most truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">José Romeu.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
